legend bottom
  <back:#FFE9A8>  Aggregate root  </back>  <back:#D6E8FF>  Entity (inside an aggregate)  </back>  <back:#DDF3DD>  Value object  </back>  <back:#F0E0F7>  Enumeration  </back>
  ""──▶"" owned by the aggregate (composition or plain association)      ""┈┈▶"" reference to another aggregate by identity only, never by object
  «id» marks the identity attribute.  Business identities use **Business Keys** (Usernames, SKUs, Emails, Names) or internal Long IDs. AuthSession uses an unpredictable UUID and references its owner by Username.
  Sprint 2 additions: KitchenConfiguration (WEB06/VIS02), ConsumptionForecast + SupplierScenario + PlanningResult (WEB07/AI01/AI02/AI06), ActivationInvitation & RoleChangeLog (AA06/AA07), AuthSession (AA04).
  Sprint 2 refinements (#29–#36): session inactivity + per-device logout, indivisible purchase lots + late proposals, email login + password recovery, resource-level authorization for multi-role users, PredefinedPizza not stock-controlled, non-pizza products included in forecasts.
endlegend

